     <td><para unique="1046542">AVX512F</para>
      <para unique="1046546">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+333270"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046548">Scale the scalar double precision floating-point values in xmm2 using the value from xmm3/m64. Under writemask k1.</para>
